    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d343">

                <pb facs="0547" n="531" xml:id="pg531"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">795.00/6–1651: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in India</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Steere</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">New Delhi</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1951-06-16T17:00:00+05:30">June 16, 1951—5 p.
                            m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>3661. Embtel 3567 June 9. Bajpai has asked whether Emb had recd info re US
                    position in which GOI interested for purpose transmission Panikkar. I replied in
                    negative.</p>
                <p>In absence response I will assume Dept not interested providing special statement
                    this character. Bajpai incidentally left Delhi today on 6 week holiday.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Steere</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
